<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world is happening?</font>

49
00:02:07,190 --> 00:02:09,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should run away too!</font>

50
00:02:09,190 --> 00:02:10,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a monster up there!</font>

51
00:02:11,770 --> 00:02:12,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A monster...?</font>

52
00:02:13,230 --> 00:02:15,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What could it be?
This monster thing?!</font>

53
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a g-gigantic snake!
It destroyed the castle in a flash!</font>

54
00:02:23,910 --> 00:02:25,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How big of a snake?!</font>

55
00:02:25,790 --> 00:02:28,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me too, at my village before...</font>

56
00:02:28,580 --> 00:02:31,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was attacked by a huge snake!</font>

57
00:02:31,170 --> 00:02:32,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We must hurry, Naruto!</font>

58
00:02:33,630 --> 00:02:37,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That snake is probably the same one
that you saw before.</font>

59
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:51,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Destroy the Leaf Village...?!</font>

60
00:03:03,370 --> 00:03:04,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And your answer is?</font>

61
00:03:18,300 --> 00:03:19,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

62
00:03:20,550 --> 00:03:23,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! You must not believe
in their sweet talk...</font>

63
00:03:24,180 --> 00:03:28,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your brother and my uncle
wouldn't want any of that!</font>

64
00:03:29,020 --> 00:03:30,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Their wishes...</font>

65
00:03:30,980 --> 00:03:33,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover, Tsunade-sama, your wishes...</font>

66
00:03:33,810 --> 00:03:36,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And dreams...
Did you forget them?!</font>

67
00:03:41,110 --> 00:03:42,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know it!</font>

68
00:03:43,660 --> 00:03:46,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you are like this now,
you still...</font>

69
00:03:49,250 --> 00:03:51,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Open your eyes! Wake up, please!</font>

70
00:03:51,580 --> 00:03:52,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up, Shizune!</font>

71
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:14,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't have to answer right now.</font>

72
00:04:15,440 --> 00:04:17,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, I want it in a week.</font>

73
00:04:18,650 --> 00:04:22,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also, two human sacrifices are needed
for this Forbidden Jutsu,</font>

74
00:04:22,990 --> 00:04:25,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so do what you need to do
to prepare them.</font>

75
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:32,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama, let's kill them right here!
It's our chance!</font>

76
00:04:32,210 --> 00:04:35,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With you and me, now we can...!</font>

77
00:04:41,760 --> 00:04:42,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama...</font>

78
00:05:20,290 --> 00:05:23,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure, I am weak now.</font>

79
00:05:23,460 --> 00:05:24,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

80
00:05:27,340 --> 00:05:30,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I also know Tsunade's weakness.</font>

81
00:05:32,140 --> 00:05:36,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right, he is one of the Sannin
like Tsunade-sama.</font>

82
00:05:37,190 --> 00:05:38,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So he knows that...</font>

83
00:05:41,190 --> 00:05:43,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see it's not cured yet...</font>

84
00:05:45,740 --> 00:05:47,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your fear of blood.</font>

85
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:51,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hemophobia...?</font>

86
00:05:55,910 --> 00:05:58,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall we get going, Kabuto?</font>

87
00:06:00,710 --> 00:06:05,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade... I'll be expecting
a favorable answer from you.</font>

88
00:06:31,450 --> 00:06:33,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like we were a little too late...</font>

89
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:37,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this that snake's doing, too?!</font>

90
00:06:37,620 --> 00:06:39,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Let's go, Naruto!
— Huh?</font>

91
00:06:39,290 --> 00:06:41,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade isn't here any more.</font>

92
00:06:41,710 --> 00:06:44,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, you keep telling me that...!</font>

93
00:06:54,260 --> 00:06:55,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Welcome!</font>

94
00:06:55,310 --> 00:06:57,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you ol' man, give me another shot!</font>

95
00:06:58,020 --> 00:07:00,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama, you're drinking too much!</font>

96
00:07:07,570 --> 00:07:08,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama...</font>

97
00:07:10,990 --> 00:07:13,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heck, she's nowhere to be found!</font>

98
00:07:14,370 --> 00:07:16,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dragging me around here and there,</font>

99
00:07:17,290 --> 00:07:19,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but after all,
we haven't found a single trace!</font>

100
00:07:20,410 --> 00:07:21,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

101
00:07:23,210 --> 00:07:25,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, let's dine here for now.</font>

102
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:26,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

103
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:29,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't this a pub?</font>

104
00:07:30,380 --> 00:07:32,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what?</font>

105
00:07:32,470 --> 00:07:36,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've told you so many times!
I'm still underage!</font>

106
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:42,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You fool. Nobody is asking you to drink.
Kids should only be eating snacks.</font>

107
00:07:43,690 --> 00:07:44,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Well then...
— Welcome!</font>

108
00:07:44,690 --> 00:07:46,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no need to dine here!</font>

109
00:07:47,150 --> 00:07:48,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can go to a ramen noodle shop
or something!</font>

110
00:07:48,730 --> 00:07:53,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How stupid! You can gather information
in this type of place...</font>

111
00:08:00,290 --> 00:08:01,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

112
00:08:01,750 --> 00:08:02,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

113
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:05,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade!</font>

114
00:08:06,250 --> 00:08:07,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jiraiya?!</font>

115
00:08:07,960 --> 00:08:10,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why... are you here?</font>

116
00:08:10,420 --> 00:08:14,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've finally found you!
I'm exhausted...</font>

117
00:08:15,470 --> 00:08:17,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That woman is Tsunade?!</font>

118
00:08:23,140 --> 00:08:25,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's 50 years old for real?</font>

119
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:27,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, that's a swindle.</font>

120
00:08:33,070 --> 00:08:36,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't believe...
I met two of the Sannin in one day.</font>

121
00:08:40,490 --> 00:08:41,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you are!</font>

122
00:08:54,550 --> 00:08:59,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case...
Today is a day I see many old friends.</font>

123
00:09:09,980 --> 00:09:11,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You mean Orochimaru...</font>

124
00:09:13,940 --> 00:09:15,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?</font>

125
00:09:18,620 --> 00:09:22,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing, really.
We exchanged a greeting.</font>

126
00:09:39,390 --> 00:09:42,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it really true that this gal
is the Kunoichi</font>

127
00:09:42,310 --> 00:09:45,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who can heal any kind of wound?</font>

128
00:09:46,890 --> 00:09:47,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about you?</font>

129
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:50,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you want from me?</font>

130
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:55,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be straight with you.</font>

131
00:10:01,830 --> 00:10:07,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade, the village has demanded
that you become the Fifth Hokage.</font>

132
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:21,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, ol' man,
gimme the simmered meat with potatoes!</font>

133
00:10:21,220 --> 00:10:22,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, in a moment.</font>

134
00:10:32,730 --> 00:10:35,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Fifth Hokage?!
What's this out of the blue?!</font>

135
00:10:35,900 --> 00:10:37,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell is going on?!</font>

136
00:10:42,280 --> 00:10:44,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you know about the Third Hokage?</font>

137
00:10:46,160 --> 00:10:49,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Third Hokage?
So, he really was...</font>

138
00:10:56,300 --> 00:10:58,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru did it, right?</font>

139
00:10:59,300 --> 00:11:02,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard about it.
directly from him.</font>

140
00:11:03,510 --> 00:11:05,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru did it...?</font>

141
00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:07,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru?!</font>

142
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:09,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did he really kill the old man,
the Third Hokage?!</font>

143
00:11:10,020 --> 00:11:11,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is this Orochimaru?!</font>

144
00:11:13,020 --> 00:11:16,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like us, he's one of the Sannin.</font>

145
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:20,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?! The Sannin are all
from Leaf Village, right?</font>

146
00:11:20,860 --> 00:11:22,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then why...?!</font>

147
00:11:22,570 --> 00:11:24,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's this brat?</font>

148
00:11:28,580 --> 00:11:30,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's Uzumaki Naruto.</font>

149
00:11:33,460 --> 00:11:36,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This brat is...
that Nine-Tailed Fox...?</font>

150
00:11:36,750 --> 00:11:38,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you just hold it there!</font>

151
00:11:39,300 --> 00:11:42,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am not done talking yet!</font>

152
00:11:43,010 --> 00:11:46,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Orochimaru?!
This bastard that killed Old Man Hokage.</font>

153
00:11:46,850 --> 00:11:48,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who the hell is he?!</font>

154
00:11:48,930 --> 00:11:51,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a legendary Sannin, right?!</font>

155
00:11:52,060 --> 00:11:53,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then knowing that...</font>

156
00:11:53,850 --> 00:11:56,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">why would you, Pervy Sage,
leave such a guy alone?!</font>

157
00:11:56,520 --> 00:11:57,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides...</font>

158
00:11:57,610 --> 00:12:00,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean this person
is the Fifth Hokage?!</font>

159
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:02,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, be quiet for a moment.</font>

160
00:12:02,610 --> 00:12:03,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...!</font>

161
00:12:04,530 --> 00:12:06,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just shut up!</font>

162
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:32,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll say this again.</font>

163
00:12:33,560 --> 00:12:39,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are demanding that
you become the Fifth Hokage, Tsunade.</font>

164
00:12:45,570 --> 00:12:47,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what's your answer?</font>

165
00:12:57,250 --> 00:12:59,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Will you accept it?</font>

166
00:13:04,880 --> 00:13:10,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll resurrect the little brother
and man, both of whom you loved...</font>

167
00:13:12,560 --> 00:13:17,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time, I will completely destroy the Leaf!</font>

168
00:13:30,530 --> 00:13:33,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you say... Tsunade?</font>

169
00:13:38,250 --> 00:13:39,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama...</font>

170
00:13:42,760 --> 00:13:44,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I really don't get it!</font>

171
00:13:54,890 --> 00:13:56,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Impossible...</font>

172
00:13:58,400 --> 00:13:59,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I refuse!</font>

173
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:10,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I remember... those words.</font>

174
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:15,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said those same words
when I asked you to go out with me.</font>

175
00:14:17,410 --> 00:14:22,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell are you talking about?!
You said it yourself!</font>

176
00:14:22,210 --> 00:14:23,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Didn't you say that
you will bring her back to the village</font>

177
00:14:24,050 --> 00:14:26,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and have her treat Sasuke
and Kakashi-sensei?!</font>

178
00:14:26,630 --> 00:14:29,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what's this demand
for her to be the Hokage?!</font>

179
00:14:29,220 --> 00:14:31,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, on top of that, she refuses!</font>

180
00:14:33,510 --> 00:14:34,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama...</font>

181
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:37,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could she be thinking of making
a deal with Orochimaru?</font>

182
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:44,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down.</font>

183
00:14:44,070 --> 00:14:46,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There can't be no other Fifth Hokage,
but this Tsunade.</font>

184
00:14:49,110 --> 00:14:51,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">During the dreadful Great War Era,</font>

185
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:53,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">she contributed tremendously
to the Leaf's victory.</font>

186
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To this date,</font>

187
00:14:58,370 --> 00:15:02,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's no one who can rival
her combat and medical skills.</font>

188
00:15:03,960 --> 00:15:07,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Still more, this Tsunade is
the granddaughter of the First Hokage.</font>

189
00:15:07,760 --> 00:15:09,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So together with her talents,</font>

190
00:15:09,260 --> 00:15:13,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's no one else more suited
to becoming the Fifth Hokage.</font>

191
00:15:14,850 --> 00:15:16,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If she becomes Hokage,</font>

192
00:15:16,270 --> 00:15:18,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that means that
she'll come back to the village.</font>

193
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:23,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then, as I'd told you,
she can treat the two.</font>

194
00:15:24,480 --> 00:15:29,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, this is what the Leaf's
top decision-making advisors settled upon.</font>

195
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:35,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genin like you have no say
on this matter.</font>

196
00:15:37,580 --> 00:15:38,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jiraiya...</font>

197
00:15:39,660 --> 00:15:42,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unlike your previous apprentice,</font>

198
00:15:42,120 --> 00:15:45,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this kid not only has a bad mouth and wit,
he's ugly to match.</font>

199
00:15:45,630 --> 00:15:46,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

200
00:15:46,920 --> 00:15:50,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's tough on anyone to be
compared to the Fourth Hokage.</font>

201
00:15:51,430 --> 00:15:55,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He had all the qualities to be
the greatest Shinobi in all history.</font>

202
00:15:56,100 --> 00:15:59,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brimming with talent in Jutsu,
and he had a brilliant mind!</font>

203
00:15:59,140 --> 00:16:04,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Popular with people and well...
he was as handsome as me.</font>

204
00:16:04,520 --> 00:16:07,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But even that Fourth Hokage died quickly.</font>

205
00:16:09,070 --> 00:16:12,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Risking his own life for the village...</font>

206
00:16:17,410 --> 00:16:18,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Life is different from money...</font>

207
00:16:22,960 --> 00:16:26,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To easily risk it and lose it,
is a fool's doing!</font>

208
00:16:32,260 --> 00:16:33,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did she say "fool"?!</font>

209
00:16:34,840 --> 00:16:37,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Both my grandfather and the Second Hokage</font>

210
00:16:37,140 --> 00:16:40,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">seemed to want to subdue
the disturbances of war above all else.</font>

211
00:16:41,350 --> 00:16:43,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But after all, they died in vain,</font>

212
00:16:43,310 --> 00:16:46,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the midst of their dreams
for the village.</font>

213
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:52,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have changed, Tsunade...</font>

214
00:16:52,900 --> 00:16:55,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know what
you thought in your heart before,</font>

215
00:16:55,530 --> 00:16:57,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but to say such a thing out loud...</font>

216
00:17:00,160 --> 00:17:02,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Although I look young,
I'm already in my 50s...</font>

217
00:17:03,210 --> 00:17:05,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Years change people.</font>

218
00:17:12,630 --> 00:17:14,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Same goes for Sarutobi-sensei...</font>

219
00:17:15,470 --> 00:17:19,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No wonder he died showing off
at that old age!</font>

220
00:17:41,660 --> 00:17:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage is a bother.</font>

221
00:17:43,250 --> 00:17:45,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No one but a fool would take it on.</font>

222
00:17:49,250 --> 00:17:50,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why you...?!</font>

223
00:17:50,250 --> 00:17:52,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Let go of me!
— Don't! We're in a pub.</font>

224
00:17:53,050 --> 00:17:54,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said, let go of me!</font>

225
00:17:55,550 --> 00:17:56,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama...!</font>

226
00:17:58,680 --> 00:18:02,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyone who makes fun of the old man
and the Fourth Hokage...</font>

227
00:18:02,600 --> 00:18:04,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't matter if
you are a woman!</font>

228
00:18:05,100 --> 00:18:08,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll punch you right in the face!</font>

229
00:18:16,700 --> 00:18:20,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're pretty gutsy...
confronting me like this.</font>

230
00:18:22,080 --> 00:18:23,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's take this outside, brat!</font>

231
00:18:24,160 --> 00:18:25,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

232
00:18:38,430 --> 00:18:41,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Though I may not look it,
I am one of the Sannin.</font>

233
00:18:44,060 --> 00:18:46,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why should I even take a Genin seriously.</font>

234
00:18:46,640 --> 00:18:47,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?!</font>

235
00:18:53,520 --> 00:18:55,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An advance notice for a KO?</font>

236
00:18:55,320 --> 00:18:56,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't mean one minute...</font>

237
00:18:57,110 --> 00:19:01,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With one finger.
This is enough to take you down.</font>

238
00:19:02,240 --> 00:19:03,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

239
00:19:03,830 --> 00:19:04,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

240
00:19:05,540 --> 00:19:07,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on, kiddo.</font>

241
00:19:08,830 --> 00:19:10,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Don't make fun of me!</font>

242
00:19:20,930 --> 00:19:22,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

243
00:19:29,600 --> 00:19:30,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

244
00:19:36,190 --> 00:19:37,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forehead poking?!</font>

245
00:19:38,030 --> 00:19:39,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why that no good...!</font>

246
00:19:45,660 --> 00:19:46,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's strong...</font>

247
00:19:48,500 --> 00:19:49,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, brat!</font>

248
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:53,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll ask you one thing before you faint.</font>

249
00:19:56,090 --> 00:20:00,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why... get so passionate at
the mention of Hokage's name?</font>

250
00:20:05,970 --> 00:20:08,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unlike you...</font>

251
00:20:09,180 --> 00:20:11,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will be the heir to the Hokage name,
no matter what!</font>

252
00:20:14,270 --> 00:20:15,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because Hokage is...</font>

253
00:20:17,650 --> 00:20:20,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because Hokage is my dream!</font>

254
00:20:24,700 --> 00:20:25,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That kid...</font>

255
00:20:33,370 --> 00:20:35,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? She's a bit off her guard...</font>

256
00:20:36,080 --> 00:20:37,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't tackle her head on.</font>

257
00:20:38,340 --> 00:20:39,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, I should use that Jutsu now...</font>

258
00:20:40,460 --> 00:20:41,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Concentrate!</font>

259
00:20:53,730 --> 00:20:54,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no!</font>

260
00:20:55,980 --> 00:20:58,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?! This Jutsu is...!</font>

261
00:20:58,690 --> 00:21:01,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

262
00:21:06,230 --> 00:21:11,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I BELIEVE YOUR PROMISE ITS TRUE HEART TO GIVE ME COURAGE</b></font></font>

263
00:21:06,230 --> 00:21:11,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I believe your promise, it's a true heart gives me courage</b></font></font>

264
00:21:11,230 --> 00:21:16,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

265
00:21:11,230 --> 00:21:16,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

266
00:21:16,200 --> 00:21:21,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>tachidomatta kado ni</b></font></font>

267
00:21:16,200 --> 00:21:21,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>on your still shoulder</b></font></font>

268
00:21:21,010 --> 00:21:25,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>asu e mukau kaze wo kanjiteta</b></font></font>

269
00:21:21,010 --> 00:21:25,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I feel the wind that blows towards tomorrow</b></font></font>

270
00:21:25,640 --> 00:21:31,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>machi no akari hoshikuzu mitai ni</b></font></font>

271
00:21:25,640 --> 00:21:31,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>the city lights are like pieces of stars</b></font></font>

272
00:21:31,580 --> 00:21:36,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>futari tsutsumu kedo</b></font></font>

273
00:21:31,580 --> 00:21:36,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>that hold us together</b></font></font>

274
00:21:36,250 --> 00:21:45,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>sorezore ni chigau kagayaki ga aru to</b></font></font>

275
00:21:36,250 --> 00:21:45,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>"each one of us glows differently"</b></font></font>

276
00:21:45,560 --> 00:21:48,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>warau kimi ga</b></font></font>

277
00:21:45,560 --> 00:21:48,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you say laughingly</b></font></font>

278
00:21:48,440 --> 00:21:54,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ichiban mabushiku mieru yo</b></font></font>

279
00:21:48,440 --> 00:21:54,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>but you look most dazzling</b></font></font>

280
00:21:54,710 --> 00:21:59,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>yume wa ryuusei no you ni</b></font></font>

281
00:21:54,710 --> 00:21:59,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like a comet</b></font></font>

282
00:21:59,140 --> 00:22:05,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ameagari no niji no you ni</b></font></font>

283
00:21:59,140 --> 00:22:05,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like the rainbow after the storm</b></font></font>

284
00:22:05,290 --> 00:22:13,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>kono kokoro ni hikari wo tsuretekuru</b></font></font>

285
00:22:05,290 --> 00:22:13,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you bring light into my heart</b></font></font>

286
00:22:13,490 --> 00:22:24,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>nayami tsuzukeru koto ga hitotsu no kotae ni naruyo</b></font></font>

287
00:22:13,490 --> 00:22:24,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>being lost can be the answer</b></font></font>

288
00:22:24,170 --> 00:22:31,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>gomakashitari shinai to chikau no</b></font></font>

289
00:22:24,170 --> 00:22:31,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>let's promise we won't cheat</b></font></font>

290
00:22:31,610 --> 00:22:36,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

291
00:22:31,610 --> 00:22:36,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

292
00:22:38,580 --> 00:22:41,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">It's been a long time since we drank
alone like this, isn't it, Tsunade?</font>

293
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:44,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I didn't necessarily want to see you.</font>

294
00:22:44,130 --> 00:22:45,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Don't say that.</font>

295
00:22:45,340 --> 00:22:47,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">By the way,
you're prettier than before.</font>

296
00:22:47,720 --> 00:22:49,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You haven't changed a bit.</font>

297
00:22:49,300 --> 00:22:52,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Understand this.
I'm not interested in you.</font>

298
00:22:52,260 --> 00:22:55,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Neither am I.
After all, you're actually 50 years old...</font>

299
00:22:56,020 --> 00:22:57,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">— Did you say something?
— No, nothing.</font>

300
00:22:57,430 --> 00:23:00,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I was just remembering
the old days.</font>

301
00:23:00,520 --> 00:23:04,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"The First Hokage's Inheritence, The Necklace That Calls Upon Death."</font>

